<title>USA: USDA ups operational GSM-102 credits to Pakistan.</title>
<headline>USDA ups operational GSM-102 credits to Pakistan.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department on Friday said it released another $76 million in export credit guarantees to Pakistan under the GSM-102 program.</p>
<p>USDA said the move completes the allocation of the entire $250 million in program coverage authorized for sales to Pakistan in fiscal year 1997.</p>
</text>
